<main class="wa-page">
  <section class="wa-hero"><div class="wa-wrap wa-hero-grid"><div><div class="wa-eyebrow">Steering & suspension</div><h1 class="wa-title">Wheel alignment service near you</h1><p class="wa-copy">A wheel alignment keeps your vehicle tracking straight, helps tires wear evenly, and supports confident handling. Our certified technicians measure and adjust the angles that matter for your vehicle.</p><a class="wa-btn" href="#book-alignment">Request an appointment →</a></div><img class="wa-hero-img" src="{{ 'ats-inline-64.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Technician performing a wheel alignment"></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section alt"><div class="wa-wrap"><div class="wa-two"><article class="wa-panel"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Signs to watch for</div><h3>Does your vehicle need a wheel alignment?</h3><p>Alignment issues can develop gradually from everyday driving, potholes, curb contact, or suspension work.</p><ul class="wa-checks"><li>Vehicle pulls to one side</li><li>Steering wheel is off-center</li><li>Uneven or rapid tire wear</li><li>Vibration or wandering while driving</li></ul></article><article class="wa-panel"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Precision service</div><h3>What’s included in a wheel alignment?</h3><p>We inspect the angles that affect tire contact, steering stability, and straight-line control.</p><ul class="wa-checks"><li>Alignment angle check</li><li>Camber, caster, and toe adjustment</li><li>Steering and suspension inspection</li><li>Road-test verification</li></ul></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section wa-dark"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Clear answers, before service</div><h2 class="wa-title">Wheel alignment — how often you need it and what it costs</h2><p class="wa-copy">Most vehicles benefit from an alignment whenever handling changes, new tires are installed, or a technician finds uneven wear. Your advisor will review the recommended service and price with you first.</p><div class="wa-cost"><article class="wa-card"><h3>After new tires</h3><p>Protect your investment by starting with a properly aligned vehicle.</p></article><article class="wa-card"><h3>After an impact</h3><p>Potholes and curb contact can affect angles even when nothing looks damaged.</p></article><article class="wa-card"><h3>When handling changes</h3><p>Pulling, vibration, or an off-center wheel are good reasons to have it checked.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Simple from start to finish</div><h2 class="wa-title">From request to back on the road</h2><p class="wa-copy">Book with a nearby store and our team will guide you through the service.</p><div class="wa-steps"><article class="wa-step"><b>1</b><h3>Request online</h3><p>Choose a location and a time that works for you.</p></article><article class="wa-step"><b>2</b><h3>Check in</h3><p>Tell us what you have noticed with steering or tire wear.</p></article><article class="wa-step"><b>3</b><h3>Inspect & adjust</h3><p>Our technician measures and corrects alignment angles.</p></article><article class="wa-step"><b>4</b><h3>Drive with confidence</h3><p>Leave with a clear service summary and next-step guidance.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section alt"><div class="wa-wrap wa-split"><img class="wa-split-img" src="{{ 'ats-inline-64.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Wheel alignment equipment in use"><div><div class="wa-eyebrow">Why it matters</div><h2 class="wa-title">Why wheel alignment matters</h2><p class="wa-copy">Correct alignment helps your tires maintain even contact with the road. That supports safer handling, smoother driving, and a longer tire life.</p><ul class="wa-checks"><li>Helps reduce uneven tire wear</li><li>Supports stable steering and handling</li><li>Helps protect your tire investment</li><li>Identifies steering or suspension concerns early</li></ul></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">The right service for your vehicle</div><h2 class="wa-title">Front-end vs. four-wheel alignment</h2><p class="wa-copy">The appropriate alignment depends on your vehicle’s suspension and manufacturer specifications.</p><div class="wa-compare"><article class="wa-card"><h3>Front-end alignment</h3><p>Adjusts the front wheels on vehicles designed for front-only service.</p></article><article class="wa-card"><h3>Four-wheel alignment</h3><p>Measures and adjusts all four wheels for a complete alignment service.</p></article><article class="wa-card"><h3>Vehicle-specific setup</h3><p>We follow the measurements and procedures appropriate for your vehicle.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section wa-dark"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Service standards</div><h2 class="wa-title">Quality parts, every time</h2><p class="wa-copy">Our technicians use professional equipment and explain what they find before work begins.</p><div class="wa-standards"><article class="wa-card"><h3>Measured accurately</h3><p>Digital measurements help ensure alignment angles are set precisely.</p></article><article class="wa-card"><h3>Clear recommendations</h3><p>We review any related tire, steering, or suspension concerns with you.</p></article><article class="wa-card"><h3>Service you can trust</h3><p>We focus on the work your vehicle needs—nothing more.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section alt"><div class="wa-wrap wa-finance"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Customer speaking with an American Tire Stores advisor"><div><div class="wa-eyebrow">Straightforward options</div><h2 class="wa-title">What does a wheel alignment cost?</h2><p class="wa-copy">Service needs can vary by vehicle and condition. Choose your location to request an appointment, and the store can confirm recommendations and pricing. Flexible financing options are also available for qualifying customers.</p><a class="wa-btn" href="/pages/financing">Explore financing →</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section wa-book" id="book-alignment"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Book at a nearby store</div><h2 class="wa-title">Book wheel alignment at your store</h2><p class="wa-copy">Select your preferred American Tire Stores location to start your service request.</p><div class="wa-book-panel"><div class="wa-book-row"><select id="alignment-store" aria-label="Choose a store"><option value="">Choose your store</option><option value="52820">Ventura</option><option value="52819">Thousand Oaks</option><option value="52819">Valencia</option><option value="61758">Hollywood</option><option value="52816">Glendale</option><option value="52818">Glendale 2</option><option value="52814">Bellflower</option><option value="52814">Costa Mesa</option><option value="52815">Cathedral City</option></select><button type="button" class="wa-btn" onclick="window.startAlignmentBooking()">Request wheel alignment →</button></div><div class="wa-widget" id="alignment-widget">Choose a store above to begin your wheel alignment request.</div></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Service Southern California drivers trust</div><h2 class="wa-title">Wheel alignment reviews</h2><div class="wa-reviews"><article class="wa-review"><div class="wa-stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The team explained why my tires were wearing unevenly and had my vehicle driving straight again.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="wa-review"><div class="wa-stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Easy to schedule, professional service, and clear recommendations without pressure.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="wa-review"><div class="wa-stars">★★★★★</div><p>“They checked the alignment after installing tires and the difference on the road was immediate.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section alt"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Find a location</div><h2 class="wa-title">Wheel alignment near you, across Southern California</h2><p class="wa-copy">Wheel alignment service is available at every American Tire Stores location.</p><div class="wa-locations"><article class="wa-location"><img src="{{ 'ats-store-ventura-ca-04-794c9478c0.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Ventura store"><div><h3>Ventura</h3><p>5100 Telegraph Rd<br>(805) 644-3330</p><a href="/pages/location-ventura-ca">Store details →</a></div></article><article class="wa-location"><img src="{{ 'ats-store-thousand-oaks-ca-04-ae8891ac85.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Thousand Oaks store"><div><h3>Thousand Oaks</h3><p>621 E Thousand Oaks Blvd<br>(805) 379-1910</p><a href="/pages/location-thousand-oaks-ca">Store details →</a></div></article><article class="wa-location"><img src="{{ 'ats-store-glendale-ca-04-95ab609611.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Glendale store"><div><h3>Glendale</h3><p>737 S Glendale Ave<br>(818) 243-3191</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ca">Store details →</a></div></article><article class="wa-location"><img src="{{ 'ats-store-glendale-ii-ca-04-8abf2eaeff.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Glendale 2 store"><div><h3>Glendale 2</h3><p>1130 S Central Ave<br>(818) 547-2010</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ii-ca">Store details →</a></div></article><article class="wa-location"><img src="{{ 'ats-store-bellflower-ca-04-b27e3f5f07.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Bellflower store"><div><h3>Bellflower</h3><p>9509 Alondra Blvd<br>(562) 804-4737</p><a href="/pages/location-bellflower-ca">Store details →</a></div></article><article class="wa-location"><img src="{{ 'ats-store-cathedral-city-ca-04-00ee05f700.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Cathedral City store"><div><h3>Cathedral City</h3><p>68406 E Palm Canyon Dr<br>(760) 469-9510</p><a href="/pages/location-cathedral-city-ca">Store details →</a></div></article></div><p class="wa-copy" style="margin-top:22px"><a class="wa-btn alt" href="/pages/locations">View all locations →</a></p></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Complete vehicle care</div><h2 class="wa-title">Related auto services</h2><div class="wa-services"><article class="wa-service"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-65.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Brake service"><div><h3>Brake service</h3><p>Keep braking performance and safety in check with a professional inspection.</p><a href="/pages/service-brake-repair">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="wa-service"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-63.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oil change"><div><h3>Oil change</h3><p>Regular oil service helps protect your engine and keep your vehicle ready.</p><a href="/pages/service-oil-change">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="wa-service"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-66.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Tire installation"><div><h3>Tire installation</h3><p>New tires installed by a team focused on fit, balance, and road-ready performance.</p><a href="/pages/tire-search">Shop tires →</a></div></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-section alt"><div class="wa-wrap wa-center"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2 class="wa-title">Wheel alignment FAQ</h2><div class="wa-faq"><details><summary>How do I know if I need a wheel alignment?</summary><p>Common signs include pulling to one side, uneven tire wear, an off-center steering wheel, or vibration while driving.</p></details><details><summary>How often should I get a wheel alignment?</summary><p>It is a good idea to have alignment checked when you install tires, notice handling changes, or after a significant road impact.</p></details><details><summary>How long does a wheel alignment take?</summary><p>Timing depends on the vehicle and its condition. Your store will confirm the expected service time when you book.</p></details><details><summary>Can an alignment help my tires last longer?</summary><p>Yes. Proper alignment can help tires wear more evenly, helping you get more usable life from your tire purchase.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an appointment?</summary><p>An appointment is recommended so the store can reserve time for your vehicle. Use the booking section above to get started.</p></details></div></div></section>

  <section class="wa-final"><div class="wa-wrap"><div class="wa-eyebrow">Drive straight. Drive confident.</div><h2 class="wa-title">Ready for wheel alignment?</h2><p class="wa-copy">Request your appointment at a nearby American Tire Stores location today.</p><a class="wa-btn" href="#book-alignment">Request an appointment →</a></div></section>
</main>

<script>
  (function(){
    window.startAlignmentBooking=function(){
      var store=document.getElementById('alignment-store'), holder=document.getElementById('alignment-widget');
      if(!store || !holder) return;
      if(!store.value){ holder.textContent='Choose your nearest store to begin your request.'; return; }
      holder.textContent='Loading appointment options for '+store.options[store.selectedIndex].text+'…';
      var init=function(){
        try {
          var config={apikey:'c097aed9ad8c441bfff05ae020ca53f0',apiKey:'c097aed9ad8c441bfff05ae020ca53f0',locationId:store.value,container:'alignment-widget',locale:'en_US'};
          if(window.TCWidget && typeof window.TCWidget.initServices==='function'){ window.TCWidget.initServices(config); return; }
          holder.innerHTML='<strong>Request received for '+store.options[store.selectedIndex].text+'.</strong><br>Please call the store directly to confirm your preferred time.';
        }catch(e){ holder.innerHTML='Please call your selected store to arrange wheel alignment service.'; }
      };
      if(window.TCWidget){ init(); return; }
      var script=document.createElement('script'); script.src='https://app.tireconnect.ca/js/widget.js'; script.async=true; script.onload=init; script.onerror=init; document.head.appendChild(script);
    };
  })();
</script>

